---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout>
  <main class="min-h-screen bg-gradient-to-br from-[#063350] via-[#0A4B75] to-[#1a7ab5] flex flex-col items-center justify-center relative overflow-hidden px-4 sm:px-6 py-20 text-center text-white">
    <!-- Fondo sutil náutico -->
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[#062438]/70 -z-10"></div>
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_at_center,_var(--tw-gradient-stops))] from-[#00A3E0]/20 via-transparent to-transparent blur-2xl -z-10 pointer-events-none"></div>

    <div class="max-w-md mx-auto z-10 flex flex-col items-center">
      <a href="/" class="inline-block mb-8 transition-transform hover:scale-105">
        <img src="/images/logo-white.png" alt="ReNaval" class="h-16 sm:h-20 w-auto object-contain drop-shadow-lg" />
      </a>

      <span class="text-[#F2B800] text-6xl sm:text-7xl font-extrabold tracking-tight drop-shadow-md mb-2">404</span>
      <h1 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold mb-4">Página no encontrada</h1>
      <p class="text-white/80 text-base leading-relaxed mb-8">
        El enlace que intentas abrir no existe o ha cambiado de ubicación. Vuelve al sitio principal para explorar nuestras soluciones de ingeniería.
      </p>

      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3.5 w-full justify-center">
        <a href="/" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 font-bold px-6 py-3.5 rounded-xl bg-[#F2B800] text-[#2D3137] hover:bg-[#e0aa00] transition-all shadow-lg hover:-translate-y-0.5 no-underline">
          &larr; Regresar al Inicio
        </a>
        <a href="/#contacto" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 font-bold px-6 py-3.5 rounded-xl bg-white/10 text-white border border-white/20 hover:bg-white/20 transition-all shadow-lg hover:-translate-y-0.5 no-underline">
          Contactar Asesor
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>

